text:
Heart-wrenching and UN-American! The utter lack of any empathy or respect for human life  - particularly children’s lives - is reflective of the dark degradation of Trump’s Administration and its increasing focus on stoking terror, undermining due process and ruthlessly and unlawfully seizing governing powers.  

What dark motives would perpetrate the dragging of children as young as 3 into immigration court - without counsel or appropriate representation. As a mom of four, I find this to be evil personified and will fight for complete accountability for these transgressions. Shameful beyond belief!

@SecMullinDHS @DHSgov @ICEgov @DOJ_EOIR

As storms grow more intense and last longer, FEMA needs a workforce ready to respond in natural disasters and emergencies. We’re ready to make that happen!

I’m proud to introduce the FEMA Workforce Planning Act, alongside @repmikeezell and @repbenniethompson – a bill ensuring FEMA recruits and retains the best workforce for timely disaster response, recovery, and relief! 

